      "sourceTextSha256": "c8a2c2a9fe3360497d362eee5c2010266f5f9d627c328f3ff724f69d9e3260fd",
      "text": "Day 18 · Sightseeing tour of Lima with an English-speaking guide, starting at the Love Park in Miraflores, overlooking the Pacific Ocean. Pass by Huaca Huallamarca, a pre-Inca administrative and religious centre, then continue to the Main Square with the Government Palace and the City Hall.\n\nVisit the Cathedral (or, if it is closed, the Lima Art Museum, MALI) and walk to the Convent of Santo Domingo, whose streets were walked by Saint Martin de Porres and Saint Rose of Lima in the 17th century.",
